-exactly when `b`, `c` and `v` are linearly independent. -/
-def planeDirectionMatrix {K : Type*} [CommRing K] (b c v : Fin 3 → K) :
-    Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) K :=
-  fun i j => ![b i, c i, v i] j
